warning renderTodoRow "todoRowFormatText's `%-40.40s` title column silently truncates titles longer than 40 bytes to 40 bytes on screen. The underlying titlesArray slot is still titleCapacity bytes (currently 128); only the rendered display is clipped. Editing a truncated row in the modal shows the full underlying title, not the truncated form."
label startRenderTodoRow
storage local immutable oneValue Int64 1
