purpose operation writeJsonEscapedStringBuffer "Write a title buffer as JSON string content with quote and backslash escaped."
invariant operation writeJsonEscapedStringBuffer "The loop reads until NUL and writes each source byte once, escaping quote and backslash before the byte reaches JSON."
label startWriteJsonEscapedStringBuffer
storage local immutable zeroIndex Int64 0
storage local immutable oneStep Int64 1
storage local immutable rawCharacterFormatText String "%c"
storage local immutable escapedQuoteText String "\\\""
storage local immutable escapedBackslashText String "\\\\"
storage local mutable readIndex Int64 zeroIndex
label writeJsonEscapedLoop
call loadTitleByteCall pointer.loadByte
argument loadTitleByteCall buffer OpaquePointer titleBuffer
argument loadTitleByteCall offset ByteCount readIndex
run loadTitleByteCall
bind value titleByte Int32 loadTitleByteCall
call nulCheckCall math.equalInt32
argument nulCheckCall left Int32 titleByte
argument nulCheckCall right Int32 nulByte
run nulCheckCall
bind value titleByteIsNul Bool nulCheckCall
branch if condition titleByteIsNul target finishWriteJsonEscaped
call quoteCheckCall math.equalInt32
argument quoteCheckCall left Int32 titleByte
argument quoteCheckCall right Int32 quoteByte
run quoteCheckCall
bind value titleByteIsQuote Bool quoteCheckCall
branch if condition titleByteIsQuote target writeEscapedQuote
call backslashCheckCall math.equalInt32
argument backslashCheckCall left Int32 titleByte
argument backslashCheckCall right Int32 backslashByte
run backslashCheckCall
bind value titleByteIsBackslash Bool backslashCheckCall
branch if condition titleByteIsBackslash target writeEscapedBackslash
call writeRawCharacterCall c.fprintf
argument writeRawCharacterCall stream FileHandle fileHandle
argument writeRawCharacterCall format String rawCharacterFormatText
argument writeRawCharacterCall character Int32 titleByte
run writeRawCharacterCall
bind value rawCharacterWriteResult Int32 writeRawCharacterCall
call rawCharacterWriteFailedCall isNegativeStatus
argument rawCharacterWriteFailedCall statusCode Int32 rawCharacterWriteResult
run rawCharacterWriteFailedCall
bind value rawCharacterWriteFailed Bool rawCharacterWriteFailedCall
branch if condition rawCharacterWriteFailed target returnJsonWriteFailed
branch else target advanceJsonEscapedLoop
label writeEscapedQuote
call writeEscapedQuoteCall c.fprintf
argument writeEscapedQuoteCall stream FileHandle fileHandle
argument writeEscapedQuoteCall format String escapedQuoteText
run writeEscapedQuoteCall
bind value escapedQuoteWriteResult Int32 writeEscapedQuoteCall
call escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall isNegativeStatus
argument escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall statusCode Int32 escapedQuoteWriteResult
run escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall
bind value escapedQuoteWriteFailed Bool escapedQuoteWriteFailedCall
branch if condition escapedQuoteWriteFailed target returnJsonWriteFailed
branch else target advanceJsonEscapedLoop
label writeEscapedBackslash
call writeEscapedBackslashCall c.fprintf
argument writeEscapedBackslashCall stream FileHandle fileHandle
argument writeEscapedBackslashCall format String escapedBackslashText
run writeEscapedBackslashCall
bind value escapedBackslashWriteResult Int32 writeEscapedBackslashCall
call escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall isNegativeStatus
argument escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall statusCode Int32 escapedBackslashWriteResult
run escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall
bind value escapedBackslashWriteFailed Bool escapedBackslashWriteFailedCall
branch if condition escapedBackslashWriteFailed target returnJsonWriteFailed
branch else target advanceJsonEscapedLoop
label advanceJsonEscapedLoop
call advanceReadIndexCall math.addInt64
argument advanceReadIndexCall left Int64 readIndex
argument advanceReadIndexCall right Int64 oneStep
run advanceReadIndexCall
bind value nextReadIndex Int64 advanceReadIndexCall
set memory readIndex nextReadIndex
jump target writeJsonEscapedLoop
label finishWriteJsonEscaped
return value SaveSucceeded
label returnJsonWriteFailed
return value SaveWriteFailed

operation saveTodosToJson
input operation saveTodosToJson doneArray OpaquePointer
input operation saveTodosToJson titlesBuffer OpaquePointer
input operation saveTodosToJson todoCount Int64
input operation saveTodosToJson titleCapacity Int64
output operation saveTodosToJson SaveTodosStatus
